  "details": "A fun little RP thing would be a Family Tree granted with a privacy setting allowing you to set who does and doesn't see it with the typical (Public, friends) etc... But only those given the rights to do so within the family could invite people into the family and the family tree would auto update to which those with right would assign roles to the given people such as \"Wife, Child, Brother, Mother, Father, Sibling.\" etc both desktop and VR users could invite someone to the family then under a drop down you would have two selectors 1.) What Role they are 2.) To what portion of the tree they belong such as me inviting someone that I want as my VRchat daughter I would then select \"Child and or daughter\" of \"Daddy Grim.\" (Yes that's really my user name.) then the system would auto arrange them in their appropriate places. Think of like starting a family group.",
